{"name": "Scallywags", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set sail with a ragtag group of Scallywags in a strategic pirate crew\u2011management roguelike. Hunt down the infamous Aces, plunder their treasures, and forge your story one chaotic voyage at a time. Every run is a fresh adventure, every choice shapes your fate, and every victory brings you closer to becoming a true Pirate Legend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"514\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770820/extras/c4992829d4c5ee0c205595894b47d192.poster.avif?t=1780416437\" width=\"1080\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770820/extras/c4992829d4c5ee0c205595894b47d192.webm?t=1780416437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770820/extras/c4992829d4c5ee0c205595894b47d192.mp4?t=1780416437\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Permadeath - Thank your lucky stars it\u2019s just a game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedural Generation - Never dull because bored Scallywags fast become Scallynags!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock Ships &amp; Gameplay - Get Bigger, Faster, Stronger!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randomized Plunder - Encourages experimentation, have fun with it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Narrative Progression -  It\u2019s not just cannons and booty! There be a tale worth discovering</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"514\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770820/extras/6f3327ad653a6b79b895920dabd01430.poster.avif?t=1780416437\" width=\"1080\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770820/extras/6f3327ad653a6b79b895920dabd01430.webm?t=1780416437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770820/extras/6f3327ad653a6b79b895920dabd01430.mp4?t=1780416437\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ship Customization - This is your paper doll, dress\u2019em up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crew Management - Bossing Scallywags around? Aye! You were born for this!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resource management - Did someone say TREASURE?!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategic Build - Play smart, be crafty, or be a chum-eating lummox.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"514\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770820/extras/a5a715096fd449177af95bfe07313f7a.poster.avif?t=1780416437\" width=\"1080\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770820/extras/a5a715096fd449177af95bfe07313f7a.webm?t=1780416437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770820/extras/a5a715096fd449177af95bfe07313f7a.mp4?t=1780416437\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique Bow Spirits - Yours to choose. They are alive, they are strong, and some ribbit!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Siren Songs - Use unique abilities to speed up the whole walking the plank thing!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Powerful Synergies - Combine effects for crazy results, like combining Blitz with Wave Shield! </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"514\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770820/extras/35eb059f2f5dec51748595cf29af1488.poster.avif?t=1780416437\" width=\"1080\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770820/extras/35eb059f2f5dec51748595cf29af1488.webm?t=1780416437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770820/extras/35eb059f2f5dec51748595cf29af1488.mp4?t=1780416437\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choices Matter - It\u2019s true. Check the Steam tags.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Amusing Characters - Sometimes they are sketchy, sometimes they have enticing offers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounters &amp; Variety - Surprising encounters multiple outcomes just to keep you on yer gnarled toes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"514\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770820/extras/a9cb4de806eb6a31fcf3b00186852ee8.poster.avif?t=1780416437\" width=\"1080\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770820/extras/a9cb4de806eb6a31fcf3b00186852ee8.webm?t=1780416437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770820/extras/a9cb4de806eb6a31fcf3b00186852ee8.mp4?t=1780416437\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aces - Face off against nine deadly Aces, Nine of \u2018em! And they arrrr beauties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bounties - \u2018Cause a bounty a day keeps the scurvy away. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"514\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770820/extras/3d9fa4a5a791e9402935cd2eb934ee83.poster.avif?t=1780416437\" width=\"1080\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770820/extras/3d9fa4a5a791e9402935cd2eb934ee83.webm?t=1780416437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770820/extras/3d9fa4a5a791e9402935cd2eb934ee83.mp4?t=1780416437\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>The only thing that matters is becoming a PIRATE LEGEND!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>(OH, and please Wishlist today... or walk the plank!)</i></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Set sail with a ragtag group of Scallywags in a strategic pirate crew\u2011management roguelike. Improve your ship, learn fantastical abilities, and hunt down the infamous Aces and their treasures. Every run is a fresh adventure and brings you closer to becoming a true Pirate Legend.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770820/9c9e7fac1c175b2f62905921a9e4d25adc600e63/header.jpg?t=1780416437", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Roguelite", "Real Time Tactics", "Management", "Tactical", "Perma Death"], "developers": "FloWHOA", "publishers": "FloWHOA", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3770820", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "18 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/rDo7Prdhe-Q", "first_seen": 1779055200.0, "review_rank": 637}